Evade Shaders
Copyright (c) 2026 John Fisher / Evade Client. All rights reserved.

Free with Evade Client. Free to use; redistribution only via evadeclient.com.

All shader source in this pack was written from scratch for Evade Shaders. It uses only
publicly documented rendering techniques (distorted shadow maps, percentage-closer filtering,
percentage-closer soft shadows, analytic Rayleigh/Mie sky scattering, screen-space reflections,
temporal anti-aliasing, the ACES filmic curve fit, interleaved gradient noise, Vogel disks,
Gerstner/sum-of-sines water waves) implemented in its own code.
